	quest.0680CD13F92CDB5D.title: "Farming and Cooking"
	quest.14ECFD19C218FC38.quest_desc: [
		"EMI is the long list of items you can see whenever you open any inventory: it will be invaluable to search items and check what you need to craft them. Search by using the bar at the bottom and press \"R\" to see the recipe of an item. You can also use \"U\" to see recipes that uses that item as well."
		""
		"Be sure to familiarize with this flow, because it's going to be very useful"
	]
	quest.1B6A790CB2F8EB4E.quest_desc: [
		"Quests are what will guide you through Ternion: you have recieved a quest book, but you can also press \"J\" to open them, without the book in your inventory. "
		""
		"These first quests are really easy, you just have to click on the checkmark present on the left. Later quests will have you submit the required items (they are not consumed, don't worry)"
	]
	quest.26645766829B807B.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Ternion! Your local, beginner-friendly kitchen sink modpack. In this first page you'll get some info about core concepts about modded Minecraft. Once you are done reading, you can move on to the \"Starting Out\" questline."
		""
		"Good luck and have fun!"
	]
	quest.363E167033B01F58.title: "Farming"
	quest.415BF5607E028A64.quest_desc: ["Modded Minecraft is a mess in terms of keybinds: this modpack is shipped with a minimal set of controls, that you will have to assign/change in the pause menu. Be careful of conflicts!"]
	quest.49CA55ECB0EAE343.quest_desc: ["Ultimine is one of the QOL mods included in this pack: by pressing the key (by default \"R\") you can mine up to 64 blocks of the same kind (i.e. stone, logs and ores). This will enable you to gather resources at a much faster pace (make sure to not veinmine your whole house down :D)"]
	quest.4C031F482241E50F.title: "Ternion"
	quest.4E173522C436B626.quest_desc: ["Bored of taking spyglasses with you in vanilla? Press \"Z\" to enable zoom and see distant things!"]
	quest.502521B48C5B8963.title: "Infinity Tools"
	quest.5C4E28C1B504AE8E.quest_desc: ["Worried your no-life friend will scoop all the loot in a thousand block radius during the first day of playing? Worry not, because Lootr is installed: basically each player on a server will have it's own loot, by having instanced chests and barrels."]
	quest.6B1EA93D39CFAEDF.title: "Storage"
	quest.6B9139D7BF5760A8.quest_desc: ["Ternion is a kitchen-sink pack at it's core, but it has certain stages of progression: basically for each category (tech, magic, exploration) there are three stages that will let you access some powerful items for that stage. The endgoal of the pack is reaching the final stage in all 3 categories to finally craft the Ternion trophy"]
	quest.76E1CC4230A48F7A.quest_desc: ["You don't have to worry much about loosing your world like you do in vanilla minecraft: FTB backups is included and will trigger an automatic backup every 30 minutes of you save, storing it in the backup folder. You can have up to 10 backups before the oldest one will get replaced by the latest"]
